# HotCorners: needs topLeft = missionControl, delay 200.
# MANUAL: set config hotCorners topLeft "missionControl", delay 200 (use_config)
ptr move 0 0 sleep 600
shot corner-rest
note Pointer rested 600 ms in the top-left corner: Mission Control opens (if topLeft is configured to it).
ipc panels close
wait 1
ptr move 300 300 sleep 200 glide 0 0 50 glide 300 300 50 sleep 500
shot corner-brief
note Gliding in and out within 100 ms: nothing opens (no Mission Control).
ptr move 300 300 sleep 200 glide 0 0 100 down sleep 600 up
shot corner-press
note Pressing a button in the corner and resting: nothing opens.
# MANUAL: a fullscreen window on that monitor -> resting in the corner does nothing
